WEBVTT

00:18:56.840 --> 00:19:00.341
Charles Darwin's father once told him

00:19:00.341 --> 00:19:05.560
that everybody could lose their mind at some point.

00:19:05.560 --> 00:19:08.391
Thankfully, we can often find them again,

00:19:08.391 --> 00:19:10.562
but only with each other's help.

00:19:10.562 --> 00:19:12.618
Thank you.

00:19:12.618 --> 00:19:16.191
(Applause)